OL,3,GNEWSAConsultation opens on 700-home
OL,4,Agolf course plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FProposals for about 700 homes on a
OL,7,Fformer golf course have raised
OL,8,Fresidents' concerns about traffic and
OL,9,Fpressure on local services.
OL,11,FWain Estates is consulting on the
OL,12,Ffuture of the 100-acre former Swinton
OL,13,FPark Golf Club site in Swinton, Greater
OL,14,FManchester, which closed in September
OL,15,F2020.
OL,17,FThe developer said more than half the
OL,18,Fsite could become public open space,
OL,19,Fwith affordable homes, sports
OL,20,Ffacilities and housing for older people
OL,21,Falso proposed.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
