OL,3,GNEWSAConsultation opens on 700-home
OL,4,Agolf course plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Mike Hartney, 65, who has lived in
OL,7,Fthe area for 34 years, said traffic was
OL,8,Falready "awful" and local services were
OL,9,Foversubscribed.
